# Public build-time setting for `npm run build:staige` (vite --mode staige). Not a secret.
# HTTPS URL of the hosted Conquest of Pizzeria game server (npm start), e.g. https://conquest-server.example.com
# Leave empty to connect to the server that serves the page (self-hosted / LAN play).
VITE_GAME_SERVER_URL=https://conquest-of-pizzeria-server.onrender.com
